### TeamForge Phase 3 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Joining and Leaving: Join Request Limits, Rejection Reasons, Member Leave, Auto-Close 5-Day Empty Projects

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@applicantToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE
@nonMemberToken = Bearer YOUR_NON_MEMBER_TOKEN_HERE
@mentorToken = Bearer YOUR_MENTOR_TOKEN_HERE
@projectId = proj-1
@joinRequestId = YOUR_JOIN_REQUEST_ID_HERE

### 1. Check My Join Request Status on Project (Initial State: "none")
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { "state": "none", "requestsUsed": 0, "requestsLeft": 2 }
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/my-request-status
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

###

### 2. Submit 1st Join Request (Success)
# Expected Status: 201 Created
# Expected Response: { id, projectId, userId, status: "pending", message: "..." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

{
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "message": "Excited to contribute to the frontend UI of this project!"
}

###

### 3. Submit Duplicate Pending Request (Refused: 409 ALREADY_PENDING)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 409, "error": "Conflict", "code": "ALREADY_PENDING", "message": "You already have a pending join request for this project." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

{
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "message": "Second attempt while pending."
}

###

### 4. Check My Request Status While Pending
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { "state": "pending", "requestsUsed": 1, "requestsLeft": 1 }
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/my-request-status
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

###

### 5. Owner Rejects Join Request Without Valid Reason (< 10 chars)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 400, "error": "Bad Request", "code": "REASON_REQUIRED", "message": "A rejection reason between 10 and 500 characters is required." }
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/{{joinRequestId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "reason": "Too short"
}

###

### 6. Non-Owner Tries to Reject Join Request
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "message": "Only the project owner can approve or reject join requests." }
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/{{joinRequestId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{nonMemberToken}}

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "reason": "Imposter attempting to reject."
}

###

### 7. Owner Rejects Join Request with Valid Reason (Success)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { id, status: "rejected", rejectionReason: "Need candidate with more React experience." }
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/{{joinRequestId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

{
  "status": "rejected",
  "reason": "Need candidate with more production React experience for this milestone."
}

###

### 8. Check Status After 1st Rejection ("rejected_can_retry")
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { "state": "rejected_can_retry", "requestsUsed": 1, "requestsLeft": 1, "lastReason": "..." }
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/my-request-status
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

###

### 9. View My Applied Projects & Requests
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Array of requests with rejectionReason, requestsUsed, requestsLeft
GET {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/mine
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

###

### 10. Withdraw a Join Request
# Expected Status: 200 OK (status updated to 'withdrawn')
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/{{joinRequestId}}
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

###

### 11. Collaborator Leaves Project - Missing/Invalid Reason (< 10 chars)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 400, "error": "Bad Request", "code": "REASON_REQUIRED", "message": "An explanation between 10 and 500 characters is required." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

{
  "category": "Too busy",
  "reason": "Too short"
}

###

### 12. Project Owner Attempts to Leave Own Project
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "code": "OWNER_CANNOT_LEAVE", "message": "Project owner cannot leave their own project." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

{
  "category": "Personal reasons",
  "reason": "Project owner attempting to leave own project."
}

###

### 13. Mentor Attempts to Leave Project
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "code": "MENTOR_CANNOT_LEAVE", "message": "A mentor cannot leave or be removed once a project has started." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{mentorToken}}

{
  "category": "Other",
  "reason": "Mentor attempting to leave project."
}

###

### 14. Non-Member Attempts to Leave Project
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "Forbidden", "code": "NOT_A_MEMBER", "message": "You are not a member of this project." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{nonMemberToken}}

{
  "category": "Conflict with the team",
  "reason": "Non-member attempting to leave project."
}

###

### 15. Collaborator Successfully Leaves Project
# Expected Status: 200 OK (or 201)
# Tasks reset to ToDo/Unassigned, owner notified with category & reason, slot freed
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{applicantToken}}

{
  "category": "Too busy",
  "reason": "Due to unexpected academic exams, I am unable to meet the upcoming milestones."
}

###
